<?php
return ['name' => 'empowered_xin_metal_the_artisan', 'displayTitle' => ['en' => 'Empowered Xin Metal – The Artisan', 'zh' => '身强辛金'], 'locales' => ['en' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Xin Metal represents precious jewels and fine metalcraft. When empowered, its energy is sharp yet refined – characterized by an exquisite strength. Its power isn\'t about brute force; it lies in precision and grace. Empowered Xin Metal can cut through obstacles with uncanny accuracy when it truly counts, much like a master artisan\'s blade. Its journey is about learning to wield this sharpness with finesse: to pair steely resolve with a sense of beauty and tact. In doing so, its strength becomes both stable and exacting, achieving results that are as delicate in detail as they are formidable in impact.</p><p>Resilient & Decisive: Beneath a composed exterior, you have a core of iron determination. You uphold principles firmly and have a keen eye for judgment, allowing you to execute plans with exact precision.<br/>Meticulous & Rational: Your mind is highly logical and detail-oriented. You strive for perfect accuracy in everything you do. This makes you reliable and thorough, but be careful – excessive rationality or obsession with details might come across as aloof or unyielding to others.<br/>Adaptable Under Pressure: Though you seem as hard-edged as a blade, you\'re surprisingly perceptive and flexible when stakes are high. In critical moments, you can pivot and adjust tactics shrewdly, proving that your apparent rigidity hides an inner resourcefulness.</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Water and Fire. As a refined steel, Empowered Xin Metal sometimes errs on the side of rigidity or formality. Welcoming Water energy introduces fluidity and wisdom, helping you loosen up and adapt, while Fire brings warmth and dynamism, fueling you with creativity and boldness. Together these elements balance your exacting nature – making your actions more flexible and your decisions more intuitive, without sacrificing your hallmark precision.</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>Wealth</h4><p>You have a bold streak when it comes to wealth-building. Big, risky investments and ventures – especially those where you call the shots solo – can appeal to you and often pay off. Armed with skill and insight, you might seize breakthrough opportunities early in life, setting you ahead of the game. Just be cautious of relying too heavily on a team; you prefer maintaining independence in decisions. Trust your own finely-honed judgment in financial matters, but also remember to diversify risk and not let success make you overconfident. A lone wolf approach can work, but ensure you\'re not isolating yourself from valuable advice in the process.</p><h4>Health</h4><p>Keep an eye on your lungs and skin, as these are areas of potential sensitivity. Ensure good ventilation in your home and workplace to ward off respiratory issues. If you\'re prone to allergies or skin irritation, use mild products and avoid extreme environments – treating your skin gently will prevent flare-ups. Regular moderate exercise and stretching are key for you, since even though you\'re strong-willed, your muscles and joints need care to stay limber. Incorporate calcium and vitamin D through diet or supplements to support your skeletal strength. Overall, by maintaining a clean environment, a balanced diet, and a consistent fitness routine, you\'ll keep your body as finely tuned as your mind.</p><h4>Emotional Wellbeing</h4><p>You tend to bottle up emotions, prizing logic over feeling, until pressure builds and emerges as sudden anger or frustration. It\'s important for an Empowered Xin Metal to find constructive emotional outlets. Competitive sports or games can be a perfect arena – they let you express aggression and drive in a healthy, rule-bound way (imagine slicing through challenges on a racquetball court or chessboard). At the same time, nurturing a calmer practice like meditation, yoga, or even simple breathing exercises will help release tension regularly. Some Xin Metal individuals find solace in creative hobbies or arts as a form of meditation – painting, woodworking, or calligraphy allow precision with a dose of tranquility. By regularly venting and centering yourself, you prevent anger from building up and maintain inner poise.</p><h4>Career Pathways</h4><p>Where You Flourish: Law & Enforcement: Positions of authority where your principled nature shines. You could be an exacting judge, a sharp prosecutor, a steadfast attorney, or a disciplined police/military officer. These roles require both precision and courage – strengths you possess in spades. Finance & Risk Analysis: Roles like investment analyst, risk manager, auditor, or tax consultant reward your analytical precision and thoroughness. You\'re able to identify patterns and flaws that others might miss, safeguarding assets and ensuring accuracy. High-Tech Craftsmanship: You excel in fields that blend technology and art. This might be UI/UX design, where you craft seamless digital experiences, or electronics engineering, where exact calculations matter. It also includes fine crafts like jewelry design or watchmaking, and even meticulous surgery or dentistry – anywhere a steady hand and keen eye are paramount. Media & Performance: Surprisingly, your perfectionism can translate into stunning performance and presentation. As an actor, singer, model, public relations specialist, speaker or host, you prepare diligently and deliver flawlessly. You bring grace under pressure in front of an audience, making complexity look effortless. Leadership & Consulting: In executive management, project leadership, strategic consulting or human resources, you impose structure and demand high standards. Teams learn to trust your judgment because you don\'t cut corners. Your combination of vision and detail keeps organizations on track. Energy & Chemical Industries: Roles such as power grid engineer, petroleum or chemical engineer, or even cosmetics R&D (where chemistry meets creativity) provide a fitting outlet for your blend of scientific rigor and innovative thinking. You enjoy perfecting formulas and systems, whether it\'s fuel efficiency or the next hit perfume. Where Energy Feels Drained: Construction & Extraction: Large-scale construction projects, real estate development, mining or geological exploration may not satisfy your need for precision. These fields often involve rough, unpredictable conditions and long timelines that can frustrate your desire for controlled, elegant solutions. Agriculture & Farming: Traditional farming, forestry, ranching or other agricultural pursuits are heavily dependent on uncontrollable factors like weather and seasons. The lack of precision and the slow pace might leave you feeling restless or underutilized. You prefer environments where meticulous planning pays off more directly.</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Bing Fire: You flourish with friends who spark change and ease in you. Bing Fire buddies will ignite your courage and enthusiasm, pushing you to seize opportunities rather than over-calculating.</li><li>Gui Water: On the other side, Gui Water friends (gentle Yin Water personalities) soothe and smooth your harder edges, helping you flow around obstacles instead of trying to carve through them every time.</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Ren Water: A Ren Water partner, with their broad-minded, open heart, can patiently embrace your sharp angles and show you how to go with life\'s flow. They encourage you to yield when flexibility is wiser than force.</li><li>Ding Fire: Meanwhile, a Ding Fire lover brings heartfelt warmth that melts your rational exterior. Their gentle passion helps draw out your emotions and reminds you that vulnerability can be a strength.</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Stephen Hawking: Theoretical physicist who unlocked secrets of black holes and the universe with brilliant precision. Despite physical limitations, his sharp intellect and perseverance changed science forever</li><li>Jacques Lacan: Innovative psychoanalyst who founded the Paris Freudian school. Known for his exacting, unconventional theories, he challenged established authorities and brought philosophical rigor to psychology</li><li>Zendaya: Emmy Award-winning actress admired for her versatility and flawless style. She approaches her roles and public image with a level of thoughtfulness and control that belies her youthful success</li><li>Liu Guoliang: Former Olympic gold medalist in table tennis turned national team coach and sports executive. Famous for his strategic mind, he revolutionized training systems with meticulous planning</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Liu Guoliang: Former Olympic gold medalist in table tennis turned national team coach and sports executive</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_dailytips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Introduce wooden elements into your environment. For example, use a wooden desk organizer or display a small wooden sculpture in your room</li><li>Set your phone or computer wallpaper to a flowing water scene – perhaps a river, waterfall, or ocean waves</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Black & Blue (Water): Black represents depth and mystery; blue brings calm and logic. These Water colors help you stay composed and mentally flexible under complex situations. Try wearing black or navy when you need to project authority without aggression, or use a blue light filter in the evenings to literally wash your world in calm blue tones. Even a small blue accessory can soothe your mind and keep your thoughts clear.</li><li>Red (Fire): Red is the color of passion, courage, and action. It\'s your power-up color when you need an extra boost of boldness to overcome hesitation. Add a dash of red – a tie, a phone case, a piece of art – in your surroundings. It will energize you, ignite your enthusiasm, and remind you to be decisive when an opportunity arises.</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>North (Water): The north symbolizes strategy and insight. Facing north when brainstorming or planning can help you tap into strategic clarity. If you\'re stuck on a problem, try orienting your desk northward or simply taking a moment facing that direction – it might surprise you how the shift in energy brings new solutions.</li><li>South (Fire): The south is associated with expansion and wealth growth. Spending time facing south or energizing the southern area of your office/home (perhaps placing a lamp or a vision board on a south wall) can attract career opportunities and financial luck. South brings a sense of warmth and momentum, aligning with your ambitions to foster greater rewards and recognition.</li></ul>']]], 'zh' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>辛金为珠玉之金，身强则金性刚锐，具备高贵而精细的特质。它的力量不在于无坚不摧的锋芒，而在于精准与优雅，能在关键时刻展现无可替代的切割力。</p><p>坚韧果决：骨子里坚韧果断，处事讲究原则，具备精准判断力与执行力。<br/>缜密理性：思维逻辑性强，追求完美细节，但需警惕过度理性显得不近人情。<br/>灵活变通：表面刚硬如刃，实则内在通透，重大利益面前能展现灵活应对能力。</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>身强辛金，喜用神为水、火。辛金如精钢，身强时锐利且果敢，但有时可能过于刚硬或拘谨。</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>财富运势</h4><p>适合高风险高回报投资，宜单打独斗求财。通过个人能力获取资源，青年时期便有突破机遇。</p><h4>健康隐患</h4><p>防范呼吸道疾病，保持室内空气流通；预防皮肤过敏；预防筋骨劳损。</p><h4>情绪管理</h4><p>容易压抑自身情绪从而产生愤怒，需要通过竞技运动、禅修打坐等方式释放。</p><h4>职业管理</h4><p>推荐行业：竞技体育：职业运动员、体育竞技、体育管理。健身培训：私人教练、健身指导、体育培训。机械加工：精密制造、机械设计、设备维修。消防：消防救援、安全防护、应急管理。物流：物资流通、仓储配送、供应链管理。二手交易：二手市场、资产处置、回收利用。水利工程：水资源管理、水利建设、水务管理。器械制造：精密仪器、机械制造、设备生产。慎重行业：农业种植：农场经营、农产品、农业合作社。陶艺制作：陶瓷工艺、手工艺品、艺术创作。仓储管理：仓库管理、物流仓储、供应链管理。重工业流水线：重工业制造、自动化生产、工业生产。金属矿产开采：采矿业、矿产开发、地质勘探。金融投资：高风险投资、证券交易、投资管理。</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>丙火：丙火能激发你的魄力。</li><li>癸水：癸水能化解你的刚锐的一面，让你在面对事情时更加变通。</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>壬水：壬水的开阔胸襟能包容你的棱角，引导你顺势而为。</li><li>丁火：丁火细腻的感情能融化你理性的外壳。</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Stephen Hawking：理论物理学家，研究黑洞与宇宙论</li><li>Jacques Lacan：创办\'巴黎弗洛伊德学派\'，挑战传统医学权威，推动精神分析哲学化</li><li>Zendaya：艾美奖最年轻视后</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>刘国梁：中国乒协主席，改革乒乓球青训体系，推动体育产业国际化</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_dailytips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>房间里多摆放木质家具</li><li>手机壁纸可以放流水图</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>黑色 / 蓝色（水）：黑色象征深邃，蓝色带来理性与冷静，能增强变通与智慧。</li><li>红色（火）：红色象征热情与果敢，能提升魄力与突破力。</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>北方（水）：北方的能量象征战略与洞察，能帮助辛金提升战略能力。</li><li>南方（火）：南方的能量象征财富与生长，利于财运。</li></ul>']]]], 'version' => 1];
